,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361541214,"data":" \"kind\": \"tpu-session-price-probe\",\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361543674,"data":" \"not_measured\": [\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361546074,"data":"  \"a declared seed: this trains the declared *shape* for --steps steps, not the protocol's 24,576,000 tokens, so it prices the queue without producing any of its records\",\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361549714,"data":"  \"the amendment's own dtype (bf16): the session's registered dtype accepts fp32 and fp16 only, so a bf16 session is a registration change rather than a flag, and fp16 is the dtype whose autocast and scaler path nothing has run on a TPU. This price is the fp32 session, which tpu_probe v5 put within 6% of bf16 on this shape\",\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361553384,"data":"  \"the eight-chips-at-once placement: one session ran on one device, and the aggregate below multiplies it by eight rather than measuring eight\",\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361558964,"data":"  \"mutation and rebuild events: the null arm never fires one, and --steps stays below the declared mutation interval, so the rebuild cost the port probe priced is not in this figure\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":791.361561594,"data":" ],\n"}
